  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Women's Paratrooper Colored Camo Fatigue Pants are designed for both comfort and style. Crafted from a durable 55% cotton and 45% polyester blend, these pants offer a perfect balance of comfort and durability. The 8-pocket design provides ample storage space for your essentials, making them ideal for outdoor activities or everyday wear. With their lightweight construction, they ensure a comfortable fit and feel throughout the day.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3805",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Women's Paratrooper Colored Camo Fatigue Pants are designed for both comfort and style. Crafted from a durable 55% cotton and 45% polyester blend, these pants offer a perfect balance of comfort and durability. The 8-pocket design provides ample storage space for your essentials, making them ideal for outdoor activities or everyday wear. With their lightweight construction, they ensure a comfortable fit and feel throughout the day. The zipper fly and button closure offer a secure fastening, while the drawstring ties allow for an adjustable fit, ensuring comfort and style. Whether you're exploring the great outdoors or running errands around town, these pants are the perfect choice. Upgrade your wardrobe with Rothco's Women's Paratrooper Colored Camo Fatigue Pants and experience both comfort and style. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
